---
title: Example · Shipping option
config:
  look: classic
  theme: dark
  railroad:
    specialStroke: "#b3b3b3"
---
%% `railroad-beta` writes the diagram as explicit constructors when no grammar notation maps onto the layout you want.
%% Constructors: `terminal("x")` · `nonterminal("rule")` · `sequence(a, b, …)` · `choice(a, b, …)` · `optional(a)` · `zeroOrMore(a)` · `oneOrMore(a)` · `special("prose")`.
railroad-beta
title "Example · Shipping option"
shipping = sequence(
  terminal("ship:"),
  choice(terminal("standard"), terminal("express"), nonterminal("pickup")),
  optional(terminal("+insurance")),
  zeroOrMore(sequence(terminal("+note:"), special("free text")))
) ;
pickup = sequence(terminal("pickup@"), oneOrMore(special("store id digit"))) ;
